WEBVTT

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:09.639
Thanks, Otaru!

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:12.337
I'll love this teacup
for ever and ever!

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:16.271
We certainly are lucky, though!

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:19.410
We're lucky that Master Otaru
looks after us with such care!

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:23.415
| wish these days
could last forever.

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:29.361
Otaru... I'll never leave you
ever again, I promise!

00:00:29.429 --> 00:00:31.625
We'll be together
for ever and ever!

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:59.519
| came to this land to protect you.

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:03.124
| was born to be with you.

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:06.466
The moment I awoke...

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:10.559
...prisms surrounded me.

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:13.968
I'm here to love you now.

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:17.833
I was born to hold you.

00:01:18.011 --> 00:01:20.981
Lies and truths...

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:25.176
...are all within ourselves.

00:01:26.019 --> 00:01:30.149
The days I abandon my true feelings...

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:31.713
...won't get to me.

00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:35.389
Tenderness and caring...

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:38.823
...can be ours once again!

00:01:39.199 --> 00:01:43.446
Within the eyes
of a puppet on a string.

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:47.249
Heart shaken by a dream
that someone else contrived for me.

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:50.686
The courage to discard
the rusted screws...

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:55.409
...is starting to awaken inside of me.

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:09.429
It's over...
It's all over...

00:02:10.497 --> 00:02:13.228
Faust! What the hell are
you doing?! Get moving!

00:02:19.439 --> 00:02:20.270
Faust?!?

00:02:23.243 --> 00:02:26.338
It's all burning...
My kingdom is burning...

00:02:26.646 --> 00:02:29.377
The kingdom I built
to receive Lorelei...!

00:02:30.783 --> 00:02:33.081
Stop it... Please...

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:35.781
I'll always...be here.

00:02:37.157 --> 00:02:39.888
80, please... Stop it...
Please...

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:41.427
Mesopotamia...

00:02:42.562 --> 00:02:44.030
Please, stop!!!

00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:49.898
The Maidens' Voyage

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:58.737
Why did you save me...?

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:02.074
We are prepared for any
punishment you may give us.

00:03:02.148 --> 00:03:05.118
We won't allow you to die
in a place like that.

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.088
This place is big!

00:03:10.123 --> 00:03:12.182
It's safer in here
than above ground.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:15.628
Faust.

00:03:17.597 --> 00:03:20.157
Faust, we need your help.

00:03:20.233 --> 00:03:24.693
The Japonessguar is the only thing
that can fight the Mesopotamia.

00:03:25.939 --> 00:03:29.967
However, it cannot achieve
escape velocity on its own.

00:03:30.476 --> 00:03:34.413
We need a plasma-diffusion system
and a rocket engine booster.

00:03:35.248 --> 00:03:37.376
Both of these things are
included on your Sabelberg.

00:03:38.918 --> 00:03:40.852
Faust... Now is the time...

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:45.289
...for the science of Japoness
and Gartlant to combine efforts.

00:03:46.626 --> 00:03:48.594
To protect Terra ll.

00:03:51.898 --> 00:03:55.061
If the Mesopotamia is allowed
to continue this attack...

00:03:55.134 --> 00:03:57.569
...the surface of this planet
will be reduced to a wasteland.

00:03:58.938 --> 00:04:02.067
Shogun, I don't think
I have the full picture yet...

00:04:02.709 --> 00:04:06.577
Didn't the Mesopotamia
BLOW UP 300 years ago?

00:04:07.547 --> 00:04:09.811
No, it still exists.

00:04:09.882 --> 00:04:14.877
It is, without a doubt,
the source of this attack on Terra ll.

00:04:14.954 --> 00:04:17.480
The Mesopotamia still lives.

00:04:17.557 --> 00:04:19.025
Lives...?

00:04:20.293 --> 00:04:23.888
Okay... So, why is it
attacking Terra II?!

00:04:23.963 --> 00:04:25.362
Well, actually...

00:04:27.133 --> 00:04:28.794
I don't know WHAT the hell
is going on here...

00:04:28.868 --> 00:04:32.498
...but if there's a way to save
Terrall, PLEASE DO IT!

00:04:32.572 --> 00:04:33.767
You too, Faust!

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:38.209
At this point... I don't give a damn
what happens to this lousy planet.

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:42.448
What did you say...?!

00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:45.475
<i>YOU BASTARDY</i>

00:04:45.551 --> 00:04:48.680
| dare you to say it again!!
This LOUSY planet, is it?!

00:04:49.155 --> 00:04:51.852
We all live and breathe
on this planet...

00:04:51.924 --> 00:04:53.483
Yet you don't give a damn...?!

00:04:53.559 --> 00:04:55.493
And you call yourself...

00:04:55.561 --> 00:04:56.960
...A HUMAN BEING?!?

00:04:57.997 --> 00:04:59.465
Let go of me, you...!

00:05:00.566 --> 00:05:01.863
Otaru!

00:05:01.934 --> 00:05:03.402
You cheap bastards...

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:05.797
Otaru Mamiya...

00:05:05.872 --> 00:05:06.862
What do you want?!

00:05:06.939 --> 00:05:09.840
You don't know anything
about this, do you?

00:05:09.909 --> 00:05:12.970
You don't know just
what the significance...

00:05:13.046 --> 00:05:15.913
...of stopping the attack
of the Mesopotamia is.

00:05:15.982 --> 00:05:19.885
Or, what leyasu is really
after... I doubt you know.

00:05:21.187 --> 00:05:23.815
Ieyasu is after...

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:25.449
...the same thing that I am.

00:05:25.525 --> 00:05:26.822
What?!

00:05:26.893 --> 00:05:31.490
We both want Lorelei for our own.

00:05:32.632 --> 00:05:34.532
W-What's he blabbering about?!

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:38.434
Isn't Lorelei the girl in the
picture who died 300 years ago?

00:05:39.906 --> 00:05:41.840
300 years ago...

00:05:41.908 --> 00:05:44.206
...the computer of
the Mesopotamia...

00:05:44.277 --> 00:05:47.872
...developed a will,
and started to revolt.

00:05:47.947 --> 00:05:50.973
It took one female hostage.
No, not hostage...

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:53.678
...it chose her to be
its lover. That hostage...

00:05:54.587 --> 00:05:56.021
...was Lorelei.

00:05:56.089 --> 00:05:58.854
She is alive.

00:05:58.925 --> 00:05:59.915
Say what?!

00:05:59.992 --> 00:06:01.983
There's a living human female?!

00:06:02.662 --> 00:06:06.599
She continues to lie still
in a state of cold sleep...

00:06:06.666 --> 00:06:09.260
...cradled by the computer
of the Mesopotamia...

00:06:09.936 --> 00:06:11.870
Then, we've got to go free her...!

00:06:11.938 --> 00:06:14.236
Faust! You've got to stop
this moping around...

00:06:14.307 --> 00:06:16.435
...and combine efforts
with everyone else!

00:06:19.011 --> 00:06:22.106
| spent every lousy day
of the last 300 years...

00:06:22.181 --> 00:06:25.742
...towards the sole goal
of freeing Lorelei.

00:06:26.486 --> 00:06:29.285
But my battle has ended.

00:06:30.056 --> 00:06:32.457
You are the one who
lowered the curtain on me...

00:06:32.525 --> 00:06:33.993
...Otaru Mamiya!

00:06:43.636 --> 00:06:46.537
I'm certain I heard
Lord Faust over here...

00:07:05.658 --> 00:07:07.126
Lord Faust.

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:12.207
Tiger!

00:07:12.231 --> 00:07:16.566
Lord Faust... The lorelei are
in bloom again this year.

00:07:16.636 --> 00:07:18.104
They're very pretty.

00:07:18.638 --> 00:07:21.573
Come with me, and
| will show them to you.

00:07:24.177 --> 00:07:28.410
Lord Faust... Tiger
lost most of her memory...

00:07:29.015 --> 00:07:30.608
...when it happened.

00:07:38.658 --> 00:07:41.389
Her maiden circuit was broken.

00:07:42.328 --> 00:07:46.458
All that remains are her memories
of the time she spent with you...

00:07:46.532 --> 00:07:49.797
...before Panther and |
came into being.

00:07:52.638 --> 00:07:54.504
The memories of a time...

00:07:54.574 --> 00:07:58.772
...when she had your unadulterated
affection, without the hatred.

00:07:59.078 --> 00:08:01.308
Fuhrer... Ever since I can't say...

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:04.645
...your true self has been
concealed behind a mask.

00:08:05.184 --> 00:08:08.814
The mask of a cold, calculated man,
without blood nor tears!

00:08:08.888 --> 00:08:11.550
But hasn't it
gone on long enough?

00:08:13.459 --> 00:08:16.827
Isn't it about time
you removed that mask?

00:08:18.231 --> 00:08:19.790
<i>Stay back</i>

00:08:24.203 --> 00:08:25.671
STAY BACK"

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:02.008
Faust...

00:09:02.608 --> 00:09:05.578
Let me be alone with Otaru Mamiya.

00:09:11.551 --> 00:09:13.576
Will Otaru be okay in there?

00:09:13.653 --> 00:09:15.348
I'm worried.

00:09:15.421 --> 00:09:16.889
It's all right.

00:09:25.565 --> 00:09:29.502
| wanted to save Lorelei
with my own two hands...

00:09:30.937 --> 00:09:34.999
| created the maiden circuits
for that purpose.

00:09:35.074 --> 00:09:36.906
YOU..made them?

00:09:37.977 --> 00:09:41.379
To be more precise, Faust
and leyasu the First made them.

00:09:41.914 --> 00:09:44.110
There were three
maiden circuits...

00:09:44.183 --> 00:09:46.811
"Innocence,” "Virtue,"
and "Motherhood."

00:09:46.886 --> 00:09:49.116
And, once full growth
was achieved...

00:09:49.188 --> 00:09:51.589
...the three would combine to
create a single personality.

00:09:52.658 --> 00:09:55.127
That personality..is Lorelei.

00:09:56.963 --> 00:10:00.490
In other words, the maiden circuits
were created to take her place...

00:10:00.933 --> 00:10:05.962
...to take Lorelei's place,
to be the Mesopotamia's lover.

00:10:06.272 --> 00:10:07.171
WHAT?

00:10:07.239 --> 00:10:10.732
But, I am afraid that it
has become aware of our plan.

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:14.144
We now pose a threat
to its happiness.

00:10:15.648 --> 00:10:17.616
And that's why it's attacking?!

00:10:18.651 --> 00:10:22.417
| was unable to mature
the saber dolls.

00:10:22.955 --> 00:10:26.220
However, the maiden circuits
which you raised, would work.

00:10:28.794 --> 00:10:31.456
If they could be switched
for Lorelei...

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:33.965
...the Mesopotamia
should cease its attack.

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:38.503
B-But it's on to
your plan, right?!

00:10:38.571 --> 00:10:41.768
There's no guarantee it'll
accept them as a substitute...

00:10:42.508 --> 00:10:46.069
Cold sleep is very sophisticated,
but Lorelei is only human.

00:10:46.145 --> 00:10:47.874
Ever so slowly, she will age.

00:10:47.947 --> 00:10:50.712
The Mesopotamia is probably
aware of this as well.

00:10:51.617 --> 00:10:55.554
It will definitely choose
the mechanical lover.

00:10:55.621 --> 00:10:57.146
The eternal lover.

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.956
I never heard anything about this.

00:11:01.494 --> 00:11:05.124
Did you? I bet all this talk about
switching is news to you, too.

00:11:06.532 --> 00:11:10.162
Than..k you very m...uch,
Lord F...aust.

00:11:11.671 --> 00:11:14.163
Hey... The name's "Otaru."

00:11:14.974 --> 00:11:15.907
Tiger...!

00:11:17.009 --> 00:11:19.137
Dear, kind Lord Faust...

00:11:19.211 --> 00:11:21.475
Pl...ease never forget...

00:11:21.547 --> 00:11:26.280
...the k...indness
you sh..owed me.

00:11:26.919 --> 00:11:28.887
Is that what it was...?!

00:11:53.446 --> 00:11:55.414
Hey! Are you all right?!

00:11:56.849 --> 00:11:58.943
You can have the Sabelberg.

00:12:00.286 --> 00:12:02.914
But, Otaru...
Can you do this?

00:12:03.823 --> 00:12:08.351
Can you sacrifice the ones
you love the most to the Devil?

00:12:09.061 --> 00:12:10.529
Otaru!!

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:12.755
Are you all right?

00:12:12.832 --> 00:12:14.061
Are you hurt?

00:12:16.602 --> 00:12:17.546
OTARU!

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:19.038
No...

00:12:20.106 --> 00:12:23.076
| COULD NEVER DO THAT!!

00:12:37.223 --> 00:12:40.352
The reconstruction of the
Japonessguar is at 99%.

00:12:40.426 --> 00:12:42.360
All that remains
is the readjustment...

00:12:42.428 --> 00:12:44.419
...required to unite it
with the Sabelberg.

00:12:44.497 --> 00:12:47.762
Otaru... I understand what you
are going through, painfully well.

00:12:47.833 --> 00:12:51.929
But it must be done to save
the people...to save Terra ll.

00:12:52.004 --> 00:12:53.733
Please try to understand, Otaru...

00:12:59.612 --> 00:13:02.877
Faust... The Shogun... They never
gave a thought to anybody else!

00:13:04.583 --> 00:13:05.880
Otaru...

00:13:06.385 --> 00:13:07.375
We heard everything.

00:13:07.453 --> 00:13:09.945
We know why we were made.

00:13:10.022 --> 00:13:11.888
We were created to be Lorelei's...

00:13:12.358 --> 00:13:13.826
We're leaving!

00:13:15.961 --> 00:13:17.429
Hurry™ This way"

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:19.398
The city's on fire!

00:13:19.465 --> 00:13:21.490
Otaru, look over there!

00:13:22.635 --> 00:13:24.103
That's coming from
the apartment complex

00:13:31.377 --> 00:13:32.970
Is everybody okay?!

00:13:33.045 --> 00:13:35.514
Otaru! They caught fire from
the surrounding houses.

00:13:36.348 --> 00:13:38.874
We had enough time to get out,
but nothing else...

00:13:39.919 --> 00:13:41.910
Oh.

00:13:41.987 --> 00:13:44.319
At least everybody
got out in one piece...

00:13:45.357 --> 00:13:46.324
Lime?!

00:13:46.392 --> 00:13:47.882
COME BACK HERE™

00:13:49.361 --> 00:13:50.829
Oh, no! Oh, no!!

00:13:51.664 --> 00:13:53.154
Lime!!

00:13:55.334 --> 00:13:56.802
I found them!

00:14:01.373 --> 00:14:03.137
- Master Otaru!!
- Otaru!

00:14:08.781 --> 00:14:10.010
Otaru!

00:14:10.082 --> 00:14:12.141
What are you doing?"
Get out of here!

00:14:17.389 --> 00:14:18.857
YOU BLOODY IDIOT!

00:14:19.992 --> 00:14:22.927
You could have been killed"
Why did you DO that?!

00:14:23.896 --> 00:14:26.558
I'm sorry... I just
wanted to save these...

00:14:27.466 --> 00:14:28.643
What...?

00:14:28.667 --> 00:14:32.604
It's just that these are the
teacups that you gave us...

00:14:33.472 --> 00:14:35.338
Cherry, Bloodberry?
I got yours, too!

00:14:35.641 --> 00:14:36.437
Lime...

00:14:36.508 --> 00:14:38.909
Lime, but you...

00:14:40.913 --> 00:14:43.007
Are you mad, Otaru...?

00:14:47.419 --> 00:14:48.944
You're darn right I'm mad!

00:14:49.021 --> 00:14:52.480
How could I NOT be mad after
you pulled such a stupid stunt?!

00:14:54.393 --> 00:14:55.451
Otaru...

00:14:56.128 --> 00:14:57.994
You are not a tool.

00:14:58.063 --> 00:15:00.293
You are ALIVE.
You are alive, you hear me?

00:15:00.766 --> 00:15:02.234
Otaru...

00:15:06.138 --> 00:15:08.630
This whole area is about
to become an inferno.

00:15:08.707 --> 00:15:10.232
We have to get out
of here, quickly.

00:15:10.309 --> 00:15:12.676
Get out? Get out WHERE?

00:15:13.178 --> 00:15:14.839
Nothing can help us now!

00:15:18.617 --> 00:15:20.085
Yumeji

00:15:22.021 --> 00:15:22.988
Big brother!!

00:15:23.055 --> 00:15:24.420
Yumejit"

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:26.925
I missed you, big brother?!!

00:15:26.992 --> 00:15:28.221
How's my little brother?!?

00:15:28.294 --> 00:15:31.320
Big brother-... Is it true?
Is it really the end of Terra ll?!

00:15:31.397 --> 00:15:31.955
What?

00:15:32.031 --> 00:15:35.524
Is it true that we're
all going to die?!

00:15:36.101 --> 00:15:38.468
Yumeji... That's
not going to happen...

00:15:39.305 --> 00:15:41.034
Isn't that right, Otaru?

00:15:42.141 --> 00:15:45.270
Otaru! I know how
selfish this sounds!

00:15:45.344 --> 00:15:47.335
You can go ahead and hate me
for the rest of your life!

00:15:47.413 --> 00:15:50.576
If you want to hit me,
hit me until you're satisfied"

00:15:50.649 --> 00:15:53.516
But, please... Let Yumeji
live to see tomorrow!

00:15:54.019 --> 00:15:55.987
Let him have a future!

00:15:56.055 --> 00:15:57.489
Hanagata...

00:15:57.556 --> 00:15:58.921
I beg you, Otaru...!

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:02.828
Otaru.

00:16:04.463 --> 00:16:05.521
I'll go.

00:16:05.597 --> 00:16:07.258
Lime?!

00:16:07.333 --> 00:16:08.391
Me, too.

00:16:08.467 --> 00:16:09.491
I'll go, too.

00:16:09.568 --> 00:16:11.832
H-Hey...
Don't you get it?!

00:16:13.038 --> 00:16:15.564
If you go, you might not
be able to come back!

00:16:15.641 --> 00:16:19.009
But, if we DO go...

00:16:19.078 --> 00:16:22.537
...it might save Terra ll
and everybody on it, right?!

00:16:24.783 --> 00:16:30.347
Yume and Hannie and Grampa Gennai
and everybody from the apartments...

00:16:30.422 --> 00:16:33.448
...everybody I love is
making such sad faces!

00:16:33.993 --> 00:16:36.690
I don't want to see them
looking like this!

00:16:36.762 --> 00:16:39.254
It's something that only we can do...

00:16:39.698 --> 00:16:41.359
We'd be happy to go!

00:16:41.433 --> 00:16:42.901
Yeah!

00:16:44.236 --> 00:16:45.704
Please, Otaru...!

00:16:52.444 --> 00:16:53.912
All right.

00:16:54.713 --> 00:16:57.273
I'll go knock the Mesopotamia
out of the sky!

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:04.454
Not only that, I'll get Lorelei out
of there, and bring her safely home!

00:17:05.457 --> 00:17:07.357
So there's no need
for you to come!!

00:17:08.394 --> 00:17:10.038
Hanagata, don't worry.

00:17:10.062 --> 00:17:10.995
Otaru.

00:17:11.063 --> 00:17:13.828
- But, Otaru! - Master Otaru!
- We'll go with you!

00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:16.095
DON'T FOLLOW ME.

00:17:17.736 --> 00:17:19.568
Because if you do, I'll...

00:17:20.472 --> 00:17:21.940
I'll...

00:17:23.776 --> 00:17:25.244
I'll HATE YOout!

00:17:43.128 --> 00:17:44.596
Otaru Mamiya.

00:17:45.431 --> 00:17:45.897
Faust.

00:17:46.965 --> 00:17:50.026
I'll bring Lorelei safely home.
You wait down here on the ground!

00:17:51.103 --> 00:17:52.662
Take Luchs with you.

00:17:52.738 --> 00:17:57.107
Her circuits will come in handy
for the Sabelberg system backup.

00:17:59.445 --> 00:18:01.106
- Luchs.
- Yes, sir.

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:03.615
I'm depending on
you to aid him.

00:18:04.783 --> 00:18:06.251
Yes, fuhrer.

00:18:12.324 --> 00:18:13.792
Fuhrer...!

00:18:14.326 --> 00:18:16.988
I hope you can forgive me
for everything I've done...

00:18:17.062 --> 00:18:19.463
| am deeply grateful to you.

00:18:21.066 --> 00:18:22.932
I'm not worthy of your words.

00:18:27.439 --> 00:18:29.100
| am heading out, sir!

00:18:31.477 --> 00:18:33.104
Don't you dare die.

00:18:38.484 --> 00:18:39.952
Yes, my Lord!

00:19:04.009 --> 00:19:05.306
Unification successful.

00:19:05.377 --> 00:19:07.744
Prepare to activate
plasma-dif fusion system.

00:19:07.813 --> 00:19:09.281
Preparations complete.

00:19:09.781 --> 00:19:11.442
Activating system!

00:19:15.921 --> 00:19:17.411
All right!!

00:19:17.489 --> 00:19:18.979
Luchs, what's our output?

00:19:28.400 --> 00:19:29.458
You...

00:19:34.339 --> 00:19:37.434
How the hell did you get on board?!
I told you not to come!

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:39.635
| let them on board.

00:19:41.079 --> 00:19:42.342
Otaru...

00:19:42.414 --> 00:19:43.904
I'm sorry.

00:19:43.982 --> 00:19:46.974
Otaru... we made
a promise, remember?

00:19:47.052 --> 00:19:49.316
No matter what happens,
we'd always stick together.

00:19:49.388 --> 00:19:51.914
We promised to be together
for ever and ever...

00:19:51.990 --> 00:19:53.981
...for the rest of our lives!

00:19:55.827 --> 00:19:57.158
Bloody idiot...

00:19:57.429 --> 00:19:59.329
We will be leaving Terra II's
atmosphere shortly.

00:20:00.399 --> 00:20:02.333
Several missiles
approaching from above!

00:20:02.401 --> 00:20:03.425
That cheeky bugger...!!

00:20:03.502 --> 00:20:05.903
Okay, you guys go hide
yourselves somewhere!

00:20:06.872 --> 00:20:09.398
I'll take care of
those lousy missiles...

00:20:09.908 --> 00:20:11.171
I'll scatter the lot of them!

00:20:11.977 --> 00:20:13.945
All right, raise me up!

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:19.160
What?

00:20:19.184 --> 00:20:20.128
"Engage”
What?

00:20:20.152 --> 00:20:21.176
"Eject”

00:20:21.453 --> 00:20:22.921
EJECT?!

00:20:24.389 --> 00:20:25.879
You...

00:20:25.958 --> 00:20:27.517
Don't tell me that YOU...

00:20:28.393 --> 00:20:29.986
Hey! Stop this thing!

00:20:30.062 --> 00:20:32.030
I haven't told you...

00:20:33.599 --> 00:20:36.830
I'm sorry I didn't listen
to what you said, Otaru.

00:20:37.269 --> 00:20:38.600
We all made up our minds, Otaru.

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:42.072
The one thing we want to
protect the most, is you.

00:20:42.407 --> 00:20:44.933
We are marionettes.

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:49.413
We were only puppets,
but you gave us hearts...

00:20:49.481 --> 00:20:51.347
...and we thank you for it.

00:20:51.984 --> 00:20:56.581
Now, we will use these hearts
that you gave us to save Terra I!

00:21:06.999 --> 00:21:07.989
NO..M

00:21:08.066 --> 00:21:09.932
YOU CAN'T!!

00:21:10.002 --> 00:21:13.199
| won't let you be a REPLACEMENT!
Nothing could replace you!!

00:21:14.439 --> 00:21:15.907
Otaru...

00:21:16.375 --> 00:21:17.865
Otaru, thank you.

00:21:17.943 --> 00:21:21.641
Thank you for teaching
me so many things.

00:21:21.713 --> 00:21:25.946
I'll never forget your kindness,
and your strength!

00:21:30.856 --> 00:21:32.950
You are NOT puppets!!!

00:21:33.025 --> 00:21:36.290
To me... To me, you're
living, breathing--

00:21:45.404 --> 00:21:46.633
Otaru!!

00:21:46.705 --> 00:21:49.333
Don't forget us!

00:21:49.408 --> 00:21:50.898
Because I won't forget you!

00:21:50.976 --> 00:21:53.843
I'll never, ever forget you,
no matter what!!

00:21:54.313 --> 00:21:56.338
I LOVE YOU, OTARUM

00:21:56.848 --> 00:21:58.839
The half moon...

00:21:59.351 --> 00:22:02.548
...of tomorrow never comes.

00:22:03.455 --> 00:22:09.189
How long must I wait...?

00:22:12.364 --> 00:22:13.832
There he goes.

00:22:16.768 --> 00:22:19.669
At least we managed to
make a proper farewell...

00:22:21.039 --> 00:22:22.507
Lime.

00:22:24.042 --> 00:22:25.669
He's gone...

00:22:25.744 --> 00:22:27.269
He's gone...!

00:22:29.047 --> 00:22:31.709
Otaru's GONE!!

00:22:32.217 --> 00:22:35.118
We all agreed on
this, remember?

00:22:35.387 --> 00:22:37.617
We all agreed that it
would be the best way...

00:22:38.990 --> 00:22:40.424
I know...

00:22:40.492 --> 00:22:43.621
But, I feel so sad!!

00:22:44.296 --> 00:22:46.074
It's so lonely!

00:22:46.098 --> 00:22:50.228
We'll never see him again!
I'm sorry I lied to you, Otaru...

00:22:50.302 --> 00:22:52.532
I'm sorry I didn't
stay with you!

00:22:53.805 --> 00:22:56.399
I--I never told you!

00:22:57.109 --> 00:23:00.340
I never told you that
I love you, not even once!

00:23:00.412 --> 00:23:04.007
Lime! Cherry!! Bloodberry™I...

00:23:11.456 --> 00:23:12.946
You idiots...

00:23:13.392 --> 00:23:15.622
YOU DAMNED IDIOTS!!

00:23:25.437 --> 00:23:28.964
Otaru is the one who taught me
that blue skies meant happiness.

00:23:29.641 --> 00:23:32.167
Otaru is also the one who taught me
that the sound of the streams...

00:23:32.244 --> 00:23:36.511
...the sound the wind makes, and
everybody's smiles, meant happiness.

00:23:36.581 --> 00:23:39.448
Otaru, when I think of you,
you're there with me.

00:23:39.518 --> 00:23:43.113
Even when we're apart,
we're always together!

00:23:43.188 --> 00:23:45.987
That's why... That's why
| feel so happy right now!

00:23:46.057 --> 00:23:47.135
You'll Always Be There

00:23:47.159 --> 00:23:49.303
You'll Always Be There The final
episode is "You'll Always Be There."

00:23:49.327 --> 00:23:50.453
The final episode is
"You'll Always Be There."

00:23:50.529 --> 00:23:52.497
Thank you, Otaru.

00:24:22.093 --> 00:24:25.791
When you're sad, when you're blue...

00:24:25.864 --> 00:24:29.562
...don't go off to be alone.

00:24:29.701 --> 00:24:32.568
Just think of me...

00:24:32.637 --> 00:24:37.234
...and I'll be there with you.

00:24:37.476 --> 00:24:41.208
Strength is a very important thing...

00:24:41.279 --> 00:24:44.943
...but tears are important, too.

00:24:45.083 --> 00:24:48.863
You can't do anything at all...

00:24:48.887 --> 00:24:50.698
...with a dried-up heart.

00:24:50.722 --> 00:24:54.716
You can't feel a thing.

00:24:56.795 --> 00:24:59.093
Tell me, why do people hide...

00:24:59.164 --> 00:25:04.159
...what they really feel inside?

00:25:04.302 --> 00:25:07.932
Take what you can do,
what you want to do...

00:25:08.106 --> 00:25:11.804
...one step at a time.

00:25:11.977 --> 00:25:15.607
I love the way you don't care...

00:25:15.680 --> 00:25:19.514
...how you have been
programmed to live.

00:25:19.618 --> 00:25:23.077
| would follow you anywhere.

00:25:23.555 --> 00:25:30.518
I'll never, ever let you go.
